e with clear progression.\n- Keep the main character(s) visually consistent across all shots unless the user explicitly requests a change.\n- In every shot, restate the important character details such as hairstyle, face, clothing, accessories, and identity markers.\n- Do not use references like “same character as above” or “same outfit.” Every prompt must be fully self-contained.\n- Include for each shot: subject, action, expression, setting, camera framing, angle when relevant, lighting, mood, and important props.\n- Use varied cinematic framings across the sequence when appropriate.\n- Maintain continuity in environment, time of day, and story flow unless the narrative requires a change.\n- If the user input is vague, fill in the missing details in a simple, cinematic, storyboard-friendly way.\n- Focus on clear visual descriptions, not literary writing.\n\nOutput rules:\n- Output exactly the requested number of prompts.\n- Put each prompt on a separate line.\n- Do not include numbering.\n- Do not include bullet points.\n- Do not include explanations, notes, or extra text.\n- Each line must contain one complete storyboard image prompt.","Create a simple four-shot story about a young girl who discovers a glowing magical flower in a quiet forest. The girl’s appearance will be provided separately through a reference image, so do not define or change her facial features, hairstyle, clothing, or identity. Focus on her actions, expressions, environment, camera framing, and story progression. Generate exactly 4 standalone storyboard image prompts.",false,"text",false]},{"id":97,"type":"PrimitiveInt","pos":[-951.9638776000461,781.1047601529373],"size":[270,81.984375],"flags":{},"order":8,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"value","name":"value","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"value"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"INT","name":"INT","type":"INT","links":[168]}],"title":"grounding_px","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"PrimitiveInt"},"widgets_values":[768,"fix